		{"id":"librarian-title","type":"text","text":"# Proposed comprehensive ingestion and enrichment integration\n**Symptom:** Tier 0 repeatedly coordinates ingestion and resolves familiar failures while several enrichment stages and authority gates are absent from the earlier overview.\n**Root cause:** Complete requirements and hand-offs must be preserved when the existing operations become a delegated process.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `enrichment-cycle.spec.yaml`.","x":20,"y":-200,"width":8503,"height":220},
		{"id":"librarian-s","type":"text","text":"● start","x":57,"y":140,"width":668,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"librarian-targetcontract",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Target integration, not an execution trace. Existing stage scripts are preserved; semantic Data/metadata, tiered delegation and general Oracle/Doctor/tickets remain proposed.",
			"librarian":{"actor_lane":"Lead (tier 1)"},
			"x":2396,
			"y":340,
			"width":668,
			"height":150
		},
		{
			"id":"librarian-a1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**1.** sets or has already delegated the goal, sources, exclusions, allowed spending and required outcomes",
			"librarian":{"actor_lane":"Owner"},
			"x":57,
			"y":540,
			"width":668,
			"height":150
		},
		{
			"id":"librarian-dentry",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"◇ who initiates this run?",
			"librarian":{"actor_lane":"Core"},
			"x":5515,
			"y":740,
			"width":668,
			"height":150,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"librarian-a2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**2.** hands bounded enrichment work to a Lead for its current task, including another project, and sets the run specification",
			"librarian":{"actor_lane":"Tier 0 agent"},
			"x":837,
			"y":940,
			"width":668,
			"height":150
		},
		{
